WEBVTT

00:02.979 --> 00:10.083
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:11.393 --> 00:13.910
- SquarePants and Star
Babysitting?
- 方裤和星星
保姆？

00:13.979 --> 00:15.462
Oh, please.
哦，拜托。

00:15.531 --> 00:19.531
What do you two nitwits know
about taking care of babies?
你们两个白痴懂什么
关于照顾婴儿？

00:19.600 --> 00:20.703
- Just watch.
- 就看吧。

00:20.772 --> 00:22.255
- Huh?
- 啊？

00:22.324 --> 00:23.462
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

00:23.531 --> 00:24.600
- Safety pin.
- 安全别针。

00:24.669 --> 00:26.531
Ointment.
软膏。

00:26.600 --> 00:28.634
- Doo-doo.
- 嘟嘟。

00:28.703 --> 00:31.738
[cries]
[哭声]

00:31.807 --> 00:33.358
[sucks]
[糟透了]

00:33.427 --> 00:36.221
- Aw, such a good
wittle squiddy.
- 噢，这么好
鱿鱼。

00:37.186 --> 00:38.462
- No one in their right mind
- 没有人头脑正常

00:38.531 --> 00:41.083
would ever hire you
as babysitters.
会雇用你
作为保姆。

00:41.152 --> 00:43.496
- Yoo-hoo!
Babysitters!
- 哟吼！
保姆们！

00:43.565 --> 00:46.462
I could use
some babysitters here.
我可以用
这里有一些保姆。

00:46.531 --> 00:48.945
- Oh, boy!
- 哦，孩子！

00:49.014 --> 00:50.910
[bang]
[砰]

00:50.979 --> 00:52.393
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

00:52.462 --> 00:53.462
[groans]
[呻吟]

00:54.876 --> 00:57.634
- SquarePants and Star
babysitters at your service.
- 方裤和星星
保姆为您服务。

00:57.703 --> 00:59.669
- We sit on babies.
- 我们坐在婴儿身上。

00:59.738 --> 01:01.393
- Not literally.
- 不是字面上的意思。

01:01.462 --> 01:03.152
- Yeah, not in Italy.
- 是的，不是在意大利。

01:03.807 --> 01:07.427
- Now you kids behave,
and listen to the babysitters.
- 现在你们孩子们表现得好，
并听保姆的话。

01:07.496 --> 01:08.496
Bye, now.
再见了。

01:08.565 --> 01:10.255
- Bye.
- 再见。

01:10.324 --> 01:14.531
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

01:16.945 --> 01:18.221
- Whoa!
- 哇！

01:18.290 --> 01:20.979
A whole legion
of little darlings.
整个军团
小宝贝们。

01:22.876 --> 01:24.221
All right, Patrick.
好吧，帕特里克。

01:24.290 --> 01:25.807
You take the east flank,
I'll take the west,
你占据东翼，
我要向西走，

01:25.876 --> 01:28.048
and we'll try to establish
a nap zone in the middle.
我们将尝试建立
中间有一个午睡区。

01:28.117 --> 01:29.600
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:29.669 --> 01:32.152
These babies
are no match for my...
这些婴儿
都配不上我的...

01:32.221 --> 01:33.462
Toddler Style.
幼儿风格。

01:33.531 --> 01:37.979
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:38.048 --> 01:43.531
[continues grunting]
[继续咕哝]

01:43.600 --> 01:45.152
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:45.876 --> 01:48.910
[babies crying]
[婴儿哭声]

01:48.979 --> 01:51.462
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:51.531 --> 01:52.738
[babies gasp]
[婴儿喘气]

01:52.807 --> 01:54.876
[babies giggling]
[婴儿咯咯笑]

01:54.945 --> 01:58.531
[groaning]
[呻吟]

01:58.600 --> 02:00.496
[hollering]
[喊叫]

02:01.703 --> 02:04.255
[babies crying]
[婴儿哭声]

02:08.152 --> 02:11.083
[babies screaming]
[婴儿尖叫声]

02:11.152 --> 02:12.634
[chewing]
[咀嚼]

02:13.807 --> 02:16.221
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

02:16.290 --> 02:18.703
- [panicked grunts]
- [惊慌的咕哝声]

02:18.772 --> 02:20.496
[continues babbling]
[继续胡言乱语]

02:23.772 --> 02:24.703
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:24.772 --> 02:26.083
- [chattering]
- [喋喋不休]

02:26.152 --> 02:28.841
- [exhales]
- [呼气]

02:28.910 --> 02:32.669
[babies crying]
[婴儿哭声]

02:33.600 --> 02:36.841
[babies cheering]
[宝宝们欢呼]

02:36.910 --> 02:37.841
[whistles]
[口哨声]

02:37.910 --> 02:39.634
Bring her down!
把她拉下来！

02:39.703 --> 02:40.772
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:43.945 --> 02:45.841
[vacuum hums]
[真空嗡嗡声]

02:45.910 --> 02:49.083
[babies murmuring]
[婴儿低语]

02:50.703 --> 02:53.565
[babies babbling]
[婴儿牙牙学语]

02:54.703 --> 02:55.634
- Yeah.
- 是的。

02:55.703 --> 02:57.427
both: Shh!
两人：嘘！

02:58.117 --> 03:01.358
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:01.427 --> 03:03.669
- And they all lived
happily ever after
- 他们都活着
从此幸福快乐

03:03.738 --> 03:06.048
inside an oyster shell.
在牡蛎壳里面。

03:06.117 --> 03:07.634
- Aww.
- 哇。

03:07.703 --> 03:11.290
Thank you,
SquarePants and Star.
谢谢你，
方裤和星星。

03:14.600 --> 03:17.255
- Babysitters!
- 保姆！

03:17.324 --> 03:20.910
- Skinny or chunky!
Clean or funky!
- 瘦或矮胖！
干净或时髦！

03:20.979 --> 03:24.290
- We won't get paid
if your kid's mislaid.
- 我们不会得到报酬
如果您的孩子丢失了。

03:24.358 --> 03:27.014
- Oh, boys.
Right here.
- 哦，孩子们。
就在这里。

03:27.083 --> 03:29.945
Oh, I could use a babysitter.
哦，我可以请个保姆。

03:30.014 --> 03:32.255
- Ooh!
- Hey!
- 哦！
- 嘿！

03:33.427 --> 03:36.324
While you go out
and dance and revel...
当你外出时
跳舞、狂欢……

03:36.393 --> 03:40.358
- We will watch
your little devil.
- 我们会观看
你的小恶魔。

03:41.669 --> 03:42.669
- Yes!
- 是的！

03:42.738 --> 03:44.807
Ooh, thank you.
哦，谢谢你。

03:44.876 --> 03:46.945
Thank you.
谢谢。

03:47.014 --> 03:49.083
- Hey, where's the baby?
- 嘿，宝宝在哪儿？

03:49.152 --> 03:51.083
- She's inside!
- 她在里面！

03:51.152 --> 03:53.841
I'm free, I'm free.
我自由了，我自由了。

03:53.910 --> 03:55.358
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

03:55.427 --> 03:56.152
- Hm.
- 嗯。

03:56.221 --> 03:57.427
[confused mutters]
[困惑的嘀咕]

04:00.565 --> 04:03.048
- Baby.
- 婴儿。

04:03.117 --> 04:04.324
Baby?
婴儿？

04:04.393 --> 04:06.393
- Is this the baby?
- 这是婴儿吗？

04:06.462 --> 04:07.876
- No, I don't think so.
- 不，我不这么认为。

04:07.945 --> 04:09.083
- Huh.
Ooh.
- 嗯。
哦。

04:09.152 --> 04:11.738
This looks like
a nice baby girl.
这看起来像
一个漂亮的女婴。

04:11.807 --> 04:13.945
- She's nice,
but she's not a baby.
- 她人很好，
但她不是婴儿。

04:14.014 --> 04:16.221
Wait a minute.
等一下。

04:17.048 --> 04:19.841
Aww, I found the baby.
哇哦，我找到宝宝了。

04:19.910 --> 04:22.531
[scary music]
[恐怖音乐]

04:22.600 --> 04:23.634
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

04:23.703 --> 04:26.393
It's the ugliest baby
I've ever seen.
这是最丑的宝宝
我曾经见过。

04:26.462 --> 04:29.048
- Patrick, all babies
are beautiful.
- 帕特里克，所有的宝宝
很漂亮。

04:29.117 --> 04:30.427
Even the ugly ones.
即使是丑陋的。

04:30.496 --> 04:32.427
Hey, we don't know
what the baby's name is.
嘿，我们不知道
宝宝的名字是什么。

04:32.496 --> 04:35.876
- She looks like she's
been in the tub too long.
- 她看起来就像是
在浴缸里呆得太久了。

04:35.945 --> 04:37.703
Let's call her Baby Prunes.
我们就叫她小李子吧。

04:37.772 --> 04:41.186
- What a pretty name.
Little Baby Prunes.
- 多么漂亮的名字啊。
小李子宝宝。

04:41.255 --> 04:42.634
[laughing]
[笑]

04:42.703 --> 04:43.738
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:43.807 --> 04:46.979
Who are you?
Where's Lazy Mary?
你是谁？
懒惰玛丽在哪里？

04:47.048 --> 04:48.462
- The baby can talk!
- 宝宝会说话了！

04:48.531 --> 04:52.186
- Help, help!
It's a robbery!
- 救命，救命！
这是抢劫！

04:52.255 --> 04:53.669
- No, Patrick.
- 不，帕特里克。

04:53.738 --> 04:56.255
Baby Prunes is just mimicking
what she's heard.
小李子只是在模仿
她听到了什么。

04:56.324 --> 04:59.703
It's just baby talk.
She's babbling.
这只是儿戏而已。
她在胡言乱语。

04:59.772 --> 05:02.807
- I'm not babbling,
you boneheads.
-我不是胡言乱语
你们这些笨蛋。

05:02.876 --> 05:04.841
- Din-din time.
- 喧闹时间。

05:04.910 --> 05:07.048
Here comes the airplane.
飞机来了。

05:07.117 --> 05:10.290
[mimicking train]
【模仿火车】

05:13.152 --> 05:14.186
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:14.255 --> 05:16.186
Yum.
嗯。

05:16.255 --> 05:18.186
Playtime!
玩耍时间！

05:18.255 --> 05:20.841
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:20.910 --> 05:23.979
Kids love to build things
with blocks.
孩子们喜欢建造东西
与块。

05:24.048 --> 05:28.358
- Heh. Oh, I'll build
something all right...
- 呵呵。哦，我会建造
没事...

05:29.152 --> 05:33.600
[harmonica music]
[口琴音乐]

05:33.669 --> 05:35.221
- Whoa, Patrick,
we've been playing in here
- 哇，帕特里克，
我们一直在这里玩

05:35.290 --> 05:37.979
for three hours.
Better check on Baby Prunes.
三个小时。
最好检查一下小西梅。

05:38.048 --> 05:40.945
You know what's
the best part of playing jail?
你知道是什么
玩监狱最好的部分是什么？

05:41.014 --> 05:43.772
- No.
- Jail break!
- 不。
- 越狱！

05:44.496 --> 05:46.152
- Jail break!
- 越狱！

05:46.221 --> 05:48.772
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:48.841 --> 05:51.807
- I gotta pick this lock
and get outta here.
- 我得撬开这把锁
离开这里。

05:51.876 --> 05:53.393
- Oh, there you are.
- 哦，你来了。

05:53.462 --> 05:54.634
Come on, come on.
来吧，来吧。

05:54.703 --> 05:55.703
- Nap time.
- 午睡时间。

05:55.772 --> 05:58.462
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:58.531 --> 06:01.669
Put me down,
you yellow scouring pad!
把我放下来，
你这个黄色百洁布！

06:01.738 --> 06:03.807
Unhand me!
松开我！

06:05.255 --> 06:06.979
No.
不。

06:07.048 --> 06:09.255
Get me out of here.
带我离开这里。

06:12.048 --> 06:13.117
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

06:13.186 --> 06:15.427
- [vocalizing]
- [发声]

06:15.496 --> 06:19.393
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

06:19.462 --> 06:21.772
- Oh, who's a colicky baby?
- 哦，谁是绞痛婴儿？

06:21.841 --> 06:25.186
It's you.
Coochie coochie coo!
是你。
咕咕咕咕！

06:25.255 --> 06:26.565
I'll go up and prepare a bath
我上去准备洗澡

06:26.634 --> 06:28.841
for Baby Prunes
for when she wakes up.
适合小李子
当她醒来时。

06:28.910 --> 06:32.910
- Okay, while you're doing
that, I'll just space out.
- 好吧，当你做的时候
那我就出去一下。

06:38.876 --> 06:41.945
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:43.186 --> 06:44.910
- Hm.
Strange.
- 嗯。
奇怪的。

06:44.979 --> 06:49.048
There don't seem to be
any baby items in here.
好像没有
这里有任何婴儿用品。

06:49.117 --> 06:53.221
Okay, pills, pills, dentures,
more pills, hemorrhoid cream.
好吧，药丸，药丸，假牙，
多吃药，痔疮膏。

06:53.290 --> 06:55.358
Ew.
呃。

06:55.427 --> 06:58.152
Happy birthday to mother
on her 137th birthday.
祝妈妈生日快乐
在她 137 岁生日那天。

06:58.221 --> 06:59.290
Aww.
哇。

06:59.358 --> 07:03.324
[gasps]
137th birthday?
[喘气]
137 岁生日？

07:03.393 --> 07:04.876
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:04.945 --> 07:09.772
Oh, Baby Prunes isn't a baby!
She's an old lady!
哦，梅干宝宝不是婴儿！
她是个老太太了！

07:09.841 --> 07:10.876
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

07:10.945 --> 07:12.255
Ah, come on.
啊，来吧。

07:12.324 --> 07:13.255
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

07:13.324 --> 07:15.600
Is that a puppy I hear?
我听到的是一只小狗吗？

07:15.669 --> 07:19.152
I didn't know they had a puppy.
我不知道他们有一只小狗。

07:19.221 --> 07:20.565
What is it, puppy?
这是什么，小狗？

07:20.634 --> 07:23.427
You want to go out?
你想出去吗？

07:23.496 --> 07:24.979
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:26.117 --> 07:29.117
Arf!
Arf, arf!
阿尔夫！
阿尔夫，阿尔夫！

07:29.186 --> 07:31.290
- Here you go, puppy.
- 给你，小狗。

07:31.358 --> 07:32.807
- So long, sucker!
- 再见，笨蛋！

07:32.876 --> 07:35.186
[laughs]
[笑]

07:35.255 --> 07:37.014
[barks]
[吠叫]

07:37.083 --> 07:40.290
- The puppy knows
baby talk, too.
- 小狗知道
儿语也是。

07:40.358 --> 07:42.979
- Patrick, she's not a baby!
- 帕特里克，她不是婴儿！

07:43.048 --> 07:47.703
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:48.979 --> 07:50.186
Where's Baby Prunes?
小李子在哪里？

07:50.255 --> 07:53.565
- I don't know.
I just let the puppy out.
- 我不知道。
我刚刚把小狗放了出来。

07:53.634 --> 07:56.910
- That was no puppy.
That was an old lady.
- 那不是小狗。
那是一位老太太。

07:56.979 --> 07:59.221
An old lady that we're
responsible for.
我们是一位老太太
负责。

07:59.290 --> 08:02.117
both: [yelling]
两人：[大喊]

08:02.186 --> 08:05.565
- If you were an old lady,
where would you go?
- 如果你是一位老太太，
你会去哪里？

08:05.634 --> 08:08.703
- I don't know.
Back in time?
- 我不知道。
回到过去？

08:08.772 --> 08:11.324
- What about a sewing circle?
- 缝纫圈怎么样？

08:11.393 --> 08:14.876
- Yes, a sewing circle
back in time.
- 是的，一个缝纫圈
回到过去。

08:14.945 --> 08:16.703
[yelling]
[大喊]

08:16.772 --> 08:18.427
- Come on.
- 快点。

08:23.393 --> 08:24.427
[boom]
[繁荣]

08:24.496 --> 08:26.014
Old Lady Prunes?
老太太李子？

08:26.083 --> 08:27.117
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

08:27.772 --> 08:30.014
- You seen a baby
that's really an old lady?
- 你看到了一个婴儿
这真的是个老太太吗？

08:30.083 --> 08:33.876
- Oh, look, they have schmutz
on their faces.
- 哦，看，他们有坏脾气
在他们的脸上。

08:33.945 --> 08:35.083
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

08:35.152 --> 08:40.014
[hocking]
[霍克]

08:40.083 --> 08:41.565
- No, not that.
- 不，不是那样。

08:41.634 --> 08:43.290
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

08:43.358 --> 08:45.841
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

08:45.910 --> 08:50.634
- Ah! Where's
Baby Old Lady Prunes?
- 啊！在哪里
宝贝老太太李子？

08:52.083 --> 08:55.841
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:55.910 --> 08:57.393
all: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

08:57.462 --> 09:02.221
- Yee-haw!
Lava-bunga!
- 哎呀！
熔岩花！

09:02.290 --> 09:03.221
- Ahh!
- 啊！

09:03.290 --> 09:04.531
- I'm okay!
- 我没事！

09:06.393 --> 09:08.945
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:11.324 --> 09:13.324
both: Yeah!
两人：是啊！

09:13.393 --> 09:17.083
- Ah! What are you doing?
You don't have a parachute.
- 啊！你在干什么？
你没有降落伞。

09:17.152 --> 09:19.772
- Parachutes are for babies.
- 降落伞是给婴儿用的。

09:19.841 --> 09:21.945
[laughs]
[笑]

09:22.014 --> 09:23.945
[continues laughing]
[继续笑]

09:24.014 --> 09:26.703
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

09:26.772 --> 09:28.186
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:28.255 --> 09:31.186
[laughs]
[笑]

09:32.393 --> 09:33.910
- Prunes!
- 李子！

09:33.979 --> 09:35.358
- Old Lady Prunes!
- 老太太李子！

09:35.427 --> 09:37.324
- Old Lady Baby Prunes!
- 老太太婴儿李子！

09:37.393 --> 09:38.324
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

09:38.393 --> 09:39.876
[punching]
[冲孔]

09:39.945 --> 09:42.462
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

09:42.531 --> 09:44.221
- Huh?
- 啊？

09:44.290 --> 09:46.083
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

09:48.531 --> 09:52.703
- Well, if it isn't
my two babysitters.
- 好吧，如果不是的话
我的两个保姆。

09:52.772 --> 09:56.117
You humiliated me.
你羞辱了我。

09:56.186 --> 09:58.531
- Prunes, you're alive.
- 梅子，你还活着。

09:58.600 --> 10:02.427
- And still talking baby talk.
- 还在说儿语。

10:02.496 --> 10:04.703
- Why I oughtta...
- 为什么我应该...

10:07.945 --> 10:10.048
both: [screaming]
两人：[尖叫]

10:11.048 --> 10:14.979
- Aww. Pruny wants to play.
Nice old lady.
- 哇。普鲁尼想玩。
好一个老太太。

10:15.048 --> 10:18.324
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:18.393 --> 10:19.324
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:19.393 --> 10:23.221
[pounding]
[重击]

10:27.600 --> 10:30.186
- [murmuring]
- [低语]

10:35.221 --> 10:36.807
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:36.876 --> 10:38.324
- Aww.
- 哇。

10:38.393 --> 10:41.772
Her boxing tuckered her out.
她的拳击让她筋疲力尽。

10:41.841 --> 10:42.876
[thud]
[砰]

10:43.600 --> 10:45.117
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:45.186 --> 10:47.083
- Aww.
- 哇。

10:47.152 --> 10:49.531
both: Shh.
两人：嘘。

10:50.634 --> 10:53.531
- Ahh.
Another job well done.
- 啊。
另一项工作做得很好。

10:53.600 --> 10:54.876
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

10:54.945 --> 10:57.910
Uh, Patrick, I think
she needs to be changed.
呃，帕特里克，我想
她需要改变。

10:57.979 --> 11:00.221
- No, that's me.
- 不，那是我。

11:00.290 --> 11:04.186
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:04.255 --> 11:11.117
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

